type: software
title: "Regolith Water Loop"
abstract: >-
  An open-hardware, three-stage water pre-treatment column that layers
  bioremediated regolith analogue and pyrolysis biochar into a gravity-fed
  filter, with a photographic method for measuring turbidity removal.
